@host = http://localhost:8080

### GET + 查询参数
GET {{host}}/api/test/get?name=张三&tag=api&tag=test
X-Demo: http-client

### POST JSON
POST {{host}}/api/test/post?source=http-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张三",
  "age": 18,
  "tags": ["api", "test"],
  "profile": {
    "city": "上海",
    "active": true
  }
}

### POST x-www-form-urlencoded
POST {{host}}/api/test/post
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=张三&age=18

### POST multipart/form-data
POST {{host}}/api/test/post
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

张三
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="message"

hello form-data
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello from http file
--WebAppBoundary--

### PUT + 路径参数 + JSON
PUT {{host}}/api/test/put/1001?operator=tester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "updated",
  "enabled": true
}

### DELETE
DELETE {{host}}/api/test/delete/1001?reason=cleanup

### PATCH 通用 Echo
PATCH {{host}}/api/echo/demo?mode=echo
Content-Type: text/plain

hello echo

### 指定 HTTP 状态码
GET {{host}}/api/test/status/418

### 文件导出 - 文本
GET {{host}}/api/test/export?format=text&filename=export.txt

### 文件导出 - JSON
GET {{host}}/api/test/export?format=json&filename=report.json

### 文件导出 - CSV（UTF-8 BOM）
GET {{host}}/api/test/export?format=csv&filename=report.csv

### 文件导出 - 二进制 1 MiB
GET {{host}}/api/test/export?format=binary&size=1048576&filename=demo.bin

### 文件导出 - 中文文件名
GET {{host}}/api/test/export?format=text&filename=导出测试.txt
